{"id": "fh-0061", "domain": "wedding seating", "names": ["Bride", "Groom", "Table1", "Table2", "Table3", "Dj", "Cake"], "text": "Hi, we're planning the seating for our wedding and I'm using this diagram to check the room. The Bride and Groom sit at the top center, so put them there. Table1, Table2 and Table3 go in a row under them. Dj should be on the far right, out of the way of the tables. Cake goes near Table2, it's on the middle table. Is Cake near Table2? Make the Cake white, so it's easy to find. Align Table1, Table2 and Table3 on the horizontal axis. Then distribute them horizontally so the gaps are equal. Rename Dj to Music, my aunt wants that label. Label Bride as \"Bride and Groom\" so people know. Which table is farthest from the Cake? Undo the last move if the tables jump somewhere strange. Oh, and how many tables do we have in total? Thanks so much.", "wires": [{"span": "put them there", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Bride,Groom", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Table1, Table2 and Table3 go in a row under them", "trigger": "go in a row", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Table1,Table2,Table3", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "Dj should be on the far right", "trigger": "should be on the far right", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Dj", "position": "right"}}, {"span": "Cake goes near Table2", "trigger": "goes near", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Cake", "position": "near", "anchor": "Table2"}}, {"span": "Is Cake near Table2", "trigger": "Is Cake near", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Cake", "position": "near", "anchor": "Table2"}}, {"span": "Make the Cake white", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cake", "color": "white"}}, {"span": "Align Table1, Table2 and Table3 on the horizontal axis", "trigger": "Align", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Table1,Table2,Table3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "distribute them horizontally", "trigger": "distribute", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "distribute", "target": "Table1,Table2,Table3", "axis": "horizontal"}}, {"span": "Rename Dj to Music", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Dj", "name": "Music"}}, {"span": "Label Bride as \"Bride and Groom\"", "trigger": "Label", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "label", "target": "Bride", "label": "Bride and Groom"}}, {"span": "Which table is farthest from the Cake", "trigger": "farthest from", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Cake", "superlative": "farthest"}}, {"span": "Undo the last move", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}, {"span": "how many tables do we have in total", "trigger": "how many tables", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
