{"id": "fh-0088", "domain": "city bus route", "names": ["Depot", "Stop1", "Stop2", "Stop3", "Mall"], "text": "I'm mapping the new bus route for the city council and I need it clean for the slides. Stop1, Stop2 and Stop3 are all on the main road, so put them in a row. Connect Depot to Stop1, then Stop1 to Stop2, Stop2 to Stop3 and Stop3 to Mall. Which stop is farthest from Depot? Mall is the terminal, so make it huge. Make Depot navy so it stands out on the map. Hmm, navy might be too dark, make it blue instead. Move Stop2 a bit to the right, around 40 pixels, because the old map had it there. Is Stop1 closest to Depot? Duplicate Stop1 two times, there are two more stops we forgot about. Oh, and rename Stop3 to Harbor, that's the local name. Put the Depot at the bottom left corner. Can you list all the circles? Thanks, the council meets on Monday.", "wires": [{"span": "put them in a row", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "arrange", "target": "Stop1,Stop2,Stop3", "layout": "row"}}, {"span": "Connect Depot to Stop1, then Stop1 to Stop2, Stop2 to Stop3 and Stop3 to Mall", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Depot,Stop1,Stop2,Stop3,Mall", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "Which stop is farthest from Depot", "trigger": "farthest from", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "nearest", "anchor": "Depot", "superlative": "farthest"}}, {"span": "make it huge", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mall", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "make it blue instead", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Depot", "color": "blue"}}, {"span": "Move Stop2 a bit to the right, around 40 pixels", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Stop2", "direction": "right", "distance": "40"}}, {"span": "Duplicate Stop1 two times", "trigger": "Duplicate", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "duplicate", "target": "Stop1", "count": "2"}}, {"span": "rename Stop3 to Harbor", "trigger": "rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Stop3", "name": "Harbor"}}, {"span": "Put the Depot at the bottom left corner", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Depot", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"span": "list all the circles", "trigger": "list", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "list", "shape": "circle"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0089", "domain": "mall marker", "names": ["Mall", "Depot"], "text": "Make Mall a large star. Also make it yellow. Thanks.", "wires": [{"span": "Make Mall a large star", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mall", "size": "large", "shape": "star"}}, {"span": "make it yellow", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Mall", "color": "yellow"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0090", "domain": "loop test", "names": ["Alpha", "Beta", "Gamma"], "text": "Connect Alpha to Beta and Beta to Gamma. Then connect Gamma to Alpha to close the loop. Is there a cycle?", "wires": [{"span": "Connect Alpha to Beta and Beta to Gamma", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Alpha,Beta,Gamma", "pairing": "chain"}}, {"span": "connect Gamma to Alpha", "trigger": "connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Gamma", "to": "Alpha"}}, {"span": "Is there a cycle", "trigger": "Is there a cycle", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "cycle"}}]}
{"id": "fh-0091", "domain": "fitness app mockup", "names": ["Header", "Body", "Nav", "Footer", "Cta"], "text": "Working on a mobile app mockup for a fitness tracker and I'm not a designer so bear with me. Header should be at the top, and Body goes right under it. Nav sits at the bottom, move it there please. Make Header large. Align Header and Body on the vertical axis so they line up. Cta is the big call to action button, make it orange and huge. Is Cta below Body? Footer goes under Nav, put it at the very bottom. Connect Header to Body with a plain line, it's just a visual connection. Which shape is the leftmost? Hmm, that should be Nav, right? Then rename Cta to StartWorkout because the dev team calls it that. Undo the last move if the nav bar broke. How many shapes are on the screen? Thanks, I'll show this to my friend tomorrow.", "wires": [{"span": "Header should be at the top", "trigger": "should be at", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Header", "position": "top"}}, {"span": "Body goes right under it", "trigger": "goes right under", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Body", "position": "below", "anchor": "Header"}}, {"span": "move it there", "trigger": "move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Nav", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Make Header large", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Header", "size": "large"}}, {"span": "Align Header and Body on the vertical axis", "trigger": "Align", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "align", "target": "Header,Body", "axis": "vertical"}}, {"span": "make it orange and huge", "trigger": "make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Cta", "color": "orange", "size": "huge"}}, {"span": "Is Cta below Body", "trigger": "Is Cta below", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Cta", "position": "below", "anchor": "Body"}}, {"span": "Footer goes under Nav", "trigger": "goes under", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Footer", "position": "below", "anchor": "Nav"}}, {"span": "put it at the very bottom", "trigger": "put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Footer", "position": "bottom"}}, {"span": "Connect Header to Body with a plain line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Header", "to": "Body", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Which shape is the leftmost", "trigger": "leftmost", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "leftmost"}}, {"span": "rename Cta to StartWorkout", "trigger": "rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Cta", "name": "StartWorkout"}}, {"span": "Undo the last move", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}, {"span": "How many shapes are on the screen", "trigger": "How many shapes", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "count"}}]}
