{"id": "fh-0093", "domain": "year 8 food web", "names": ["Coral", "Fish", "Kelp", "Plankton", "Shark", "Pollution"], "text": "I'm a biology teacher making a food web diagram for year 8. Plankton feeds Fish, and Kelp feeds Fish too. Fish feeds Shark. Make Shark a large red diamond so the kids remember it is the top predator. Pollution goes into Coral, can you link them? Hmm, pollution isn't food, let's drop that line. Connect Coral to Kelp with a dotted line, it's a symbiosis. Put Plankton at the bottom left. Move Kelp above Coral. Is Shark bigger than Fish? Which shape has the most connections? Rename Kelp to Seaweed, that's what the textbook says. Undo the last change if the layout is worse. Thanks!", "wires": [{"span": "Plankton feeds Fish, and Kelp feeds Fish too", "trigger": "feeds", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Plankton,Kelp", "to": "Fish"}}, {"span": "Fish feeds Shark", "trigger": "feeds", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Fish", "to": "Shark"}}, {"span": "Make Shark a large red diamond", "trigger": "Make", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "set", "target": "Shark", "size": "large", "color": "red", "shape": "diamond"}}, {"span": "Connect Coral to Kelp with a dotted line", "trigger": "Connect", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "connect", "from": "Coral", "to": "Kelp", "style": "dotted", "arrow": "none"}}, {"span": "Put Plankton at the bottom left", "trigger": "Put", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Plankton", "position": "bottomLeft"}}, {"span": "Move Kelp above Coral", "trigger": "Move", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "move", "target": "Kelp", "position": "above", "anchor": "Coral"}}, {"span": "Is Shark bigger than Fish", "trigger": "bigger than", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "check", "target": "Shark", "comparison": "bigger", "anchor": "Fish"}}, {"span": "Which shape has the most connections", "trigger": "most connections", "type": "question", "args": {"ask": "extreme", "superlative": "mostConnected"}}, {"span": "Rename Kelp to Seaweed", "trigger": "Rename", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "rename", "target": "Kelp", "name": "Seaweed"}}, {"span": "Undo the last change", "trigger": "Undo", "type": "command", "args": {"action": "undo"}}]}
